#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:5
msgid "Undo panel"
msgstr "撤消面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Undo panel lists all actions made by the user inside the `element "
"editor`_ from last save."
msgstr "Undo 面板列出用户在 `元素编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 从上次保存中所做的全部动作。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:12
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Undo panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:14
msgid "To display the Undo panel:"
msgstr "要显示撤消面板："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:16
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Undo** menu item to display the Undo panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 撤销** 菜单项以显示撤消面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/undo.rst:20
msgid ""
"For more information about the actions for which the Undo panel can be "
"useful, refer to `Undo panel`_ section from `QElectroTech main window`_."
msgstr ""
"关于Undo面板可以使用的行动的更多信息，请参见 `Undo面板 <Undo panel_>`_ 从 `QElectroTech主窗口 "
"<QElectroTech main window_>`_ 的一节。"
